     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi guys,<br><br>I am fitting a model and at first it seems everything just right:<br><br><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:10pt!important;outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap!important;line-height:15px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:-webkit-left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\">summary(fit)\n</span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap!important\">lavaan (0.5-20) converged normally after  76 iterations\n</span></span></pre><br><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:10pt!important;outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap!important;line-height:15px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:-webkit-left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\">inspect(fit, &quot;converged&quot;) \n</span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap!important\">[1] TRUE<br><br>but when I try to get some insights about an improvement I get the error: What is going on?<br></span></span><span><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\">subset(modindices(fit), mi&gt;15)<br><br></span></span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Warning message:\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">In lavaan(slotOptions = object@Options, slotParTable = object@ParTable,  :\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"> lavaan WARNING: model has NOT converged!<br><br></span></span><span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap!important\">What is going on?<br><br>thanks!<br></span></span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"></span></span><span><span style=\"color:blue\"></span></span><span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"></span></span></pre></div>"
